<title>UK: BayernLB sets 150 million Swiss franc bond.</title>
<headline>BayernLB sets 150 million Swiss franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS Zurich.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN CHF   COUPON     2.50	MATURITY    26.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.75    PAY DATE    26.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SWISS     HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	WITH REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
